# skills: the other party orders, and an ally already raised is passed over. Jian and Rufus
# (party_rufus), Rufus at level 42 (level index 41 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple battle.
# Jian's DEF stage is poked to 1 beforehand. Round 1 Shield Wall (third entry: Right): the DEF UP banner on Rufus only (po_def_*), MP 50 -> 38, Rufus's DEF stage 0 -> 1, Jian's
# stays 1. Round 2 Forced March (fourth: Right, Down): AGI UP on both, MP 50 -> 40, both AGI stages 0 -> 1.
# Round 3 War Council (fifth: Right, Right): INT UP on both, MP 50 -> 38, both INT stages 0 -> 1.
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18, ATK DEF AGI INT +0x24 +0x28 +0x30 +0x34, their stages +0x40 +0x42 +0x44 +0x46). Run with --save.
include party_rufus
pin u32 0x020B47D4 41
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x84 50
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e8e4 rufus_mp
watch u16 0x0228e8a0 jian_atk_stage
watch u32 0x0228e884 jian_atk
watch u16 0x0228e8a2 jian_def_stage
watch u32 0x0228e888 jian_def
watch u16 0x0228e8a4 jian_agi_stage
watch u32 0x0228e890 jian_agi
watch u16 0x0228e8a6 jian_int_stage
watch u32 0x0228e894 jian_int
watch u16 0x0228e90c rufus_atk_stage
watch u32 0x0228e8f0 rufus_atk
watch u16 0x0228e90e rufus_def_stage
watch u32 0x0228e8f4 rufus_def
watch u16 0x0228e910 rufus_agi_stage
watch u32 0x0228e8fc rufus_agi
watch u16 0x0228e912 rufus_int_stage
watch u32 0x0228e900 rufus_int
poke u16 0x0228e8a2 1
press A 8
wait 50
